; ==============================================================================
;  config\menus\media.rc  -  shared by the themes; no look here (icons come from variables
;  each theme defines: none; empty = no icon).
;  Player controls; they follow the player chosen with !MediaPlayerNext (Core). Variant for *Popup; menus\media-startmenu.rc has the same entries for *PopupStartMenu.
;  Owned by the repo: deploy and the installer overwrite it. Personal additions go in
;  personal.rc (star lines there add items).
; ==============================================================================
*Popup "Anterior" !MediaPrev
*Popup "Play / Pausa" !MediaPlayPause
*Popup "Siguiente" !MediaNext
